124-- Compute review/smoke verdicts from validated evidence and explicit severity rules, not from runtime exit success or unstructured model prose alone.
125-- Preserve exact requirements and code-context bytes in one shared prompt prefix before stage-specific instructions; downstream agents may still inspect additional live source.
126:- Keep Markdown authoritative initially. Any later search record or knowledge graph is derived and rebuildable; any later SQLite authority is an explicit product-mode decision rather than a web-side shadow store.
